What is printed?
```
int x = 1;
do {
    printf("%d ", x);
    x = x * 2 + 1;
} while (x < 20);
```

What is printed?
```
int age = 12;
int fee = 1000 + (age < 12 ? 200 : 500);
printf("%d", fee);
```

`lines.txt` holds three lines, `one`, `two` and `three`, each ending with a newline. What is printed?
```
FILE *fp = fopen("lines.txt", "r");
int ch, n = 0;
while ((ch = fgetc(fp)) != EOF)
    if (ch == '\n')
        n++;
fclose(fp);
printf("%d", n);
```
